ues\\n- **Priority**: P2\\n- **Added**: 2026-03-06\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\\n## Groomed (2026-04-23)\\n\\n### Acceptance Criteria\\n\\n- [ ] `Task.name` is populated from the GitHub issue title (not `task_id`) in `fetch_tasks_from_github` and `_load_tasks_from_cache`\\n- [ ] `uv run sam status P{N}` output shows human-readable task names for GitHub-fetched plans\\n- [ ] Existing tests continue to pass; new test verifies `Task.name == issue.title` for a GitHub-fetched task\\n- [ ] `uv run ty check plugins/development-harness/sam_schema/` \u2014 zero errors on modified files\\n\\n### Files\\n\\n- `plugins/development-harness/sam_schema/` \u2014 fetch_tasks_from_github and _load_tasks_from_cache functions (exact file TBD by search)\\n- `plugins/development-harness/tests/` or `tests_sam/` \u2014 test for name field population\\n\\n### Story\\n\\nAs a **developer running `sam status`**, I want **task names to show the issue title not the task ID** so that **status output is human-readable without cross-referencing the task file**.\\n\\n## Artifact Manifest\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n<!-- artifact-manifest:begin -->\\n| Type | Path | Status | Agent | Created |\\n|------|------|--------|-------|---------|\\n| task-plan | plan/P032-migrate-sam-task-github-subissues-followup-3.yaml | current | dh_migrate | 2026-03-24T16:35:00Z |\\n<!-- artifact-manifest:end -->\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"9eeceb415472d0509502da4036d2787830c629e2f805b4f8c196cad9044bd487\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABPg0ffA\"}"}